# 3. Overall Business Workflow

The final workflow should be:

```text
NOC Engineer
     |
     | Enter Site Code
     v
Gateway
     |
     v
Orchestrator creates asynchronous job
     |
     v
Zabbix Discovery
     |
     +-----------------------+
     |                       |
     v                       v
Discover basebands      Discover Cisco devices
     |
     v
Discover outgoing radio links
     |
     +-----------------------+
     |           |           |
     v           v           v
   Cisco      Ericsson     Radio
   checks     Moshell      analysis
     |           |           |
     +-----------+-----------+
                 |
                 v
        Collect real results
                 |
                 v
       Aggregate health status
                 |
                 v
       Audit reaches COMPLETED
                 |
                 v
      Generate Excel automatically
                 |
                 v
       Gateway returns audit data
                 |
                 v
       Web dashboard displays results
                 |
                 v
       User downloads Excel report
```

The operator must enter only the Site Code.

Never require the operator to manually enter device IP addresses.

Zabbix API is the source of truth for site discovery and monitoring data. Do not use Zabbix database cloning or HTML scraping.

