## Gateway report behavior

The Gateway calls the Orchestrator to retrieve a completed audit.

It then returns report metadata through:

```text
GET /audit/{job_id}/report
```

Direct Excel download is provided through:

```text
GET /audit/{job_id}/report/download
```

The endpoint proxies the actual XLSX bytes from the Report Service and returns them to the browser.

The Gateway also has fallback report generation logic for completed audits when report metadata is absent.

This flow has been tested successfully.

## Known dashboard limitation

The first version of the radio table is not yet the required final presentation.

The user wants a single unified `Links` table with numeric values and light styling, as specified in Sections 10 and 12.

The bottom-of-page section with the latest ten logs from both Cisco devices also remains to be verified and implemented.

The user also wants the second baseband and NCS switch to appear correctly in the dashboard.

