# 15. Docker and Docker Compose Migration

This is an active migration goal.

The user wants all seven microservices containerized and controlled together using Docker Compose.

The intended deployment is:

```text
Browser
   |
   v
Gateway container
   |
   v
Orchestrator container
   |
   +------------------+
   |        |         |
   v        v         v
 Zabbix   Cisco   Ericsson
 Service  Service  Service
   |
   v
 Radio Service

 Report Service
```

Use a shared internal Docker bridge network.

The only application container expected to publish a host port is Gateway.

The testing port was intended to be:

```text
Host 18000 → Gateway container 8000
```

The eventual production port should be:

```text
Host 8000 → Gateway container 8000
```

Do not switch production traffic until the test deployment passes acceptance checks.

